  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/95c213b377d7cb2f72e5aed4678e5527fce29253034e495ae617ace309ff2cfc.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nGiven equation: 18 × 3 + 15 ÷ 4 - 44 = 22 \n\nOption 1) × and -\n\nAfter interchange the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 18 - 3 + __**15 ÷ 4**__ × 44 = 22 \n\n⇒ 18 - 3 + __3.75____** ×**____** 44**__ = 22 \n\n⇒ __**18 **__- 3 + **__165__** = 22 \n\n⇒ __183** ****- 3**__ = 22 \n\n⇒ 180 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) × and +\n\nAfter interchange the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 18 + __**3 × 15 ÷ 4**__ - 44 = 22 \n\n⇒ __**18 +**____** **__**__11.25__ **- 44 = 22 \n\n⇒** __29.25 - 44__** = 22 \n\n⇒ -14.75 ≠ 59\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ÷ \n\nAfter interchange the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**18 × 3 ÷ 15**__ + 4 - 44 = 22 \n\n⇒ __3.6__**__ + 4__** - 44 = 22 \n\n⇒ **__7.6__** __**- 44**__ = 22\n\n⇒ -36.4 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4**) ****× and ÷**\n\nAfter interchange the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**18 ÷ 3**__ + 15 × 4 - 44 = 22 \n\n⇒ 6 + **__15 × 4__** - 44 = 22 \n\n⇒ __**6 + **____60__ - 44 = 22 \n\n⇒ **__66__****__ - 44__** = 22 \n\n⇒ 22 = 22\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
